<div class="container article-shell"><div class="article-breadcrumb"><a href="<%= url_for('/') %>">朝光</a><span>/</span><a href="<%= url_for('archives/') %>">文章</a><span>/</span><span><%= cg_category(page) %></span></div><header class="article-header"><p class="section-kicker">FIELD NOTES / 向光生长的记录</p><h1><%= page.title %></h1><p class="article-description"><%= page.description %></p><div class="article-meta"><span class="mini-avatar"><%- cg_icon('sun') %></span><span><%= config.author %></span><span>·</span><time datetime="<%= date_xml(page.date) %>"><%= date(page.date) %></time><span>·</span><span><%= cg_reading(page.content) %> 分钟阅读</span><% if (page.demo) { %><span class="demo-badge">示例文章</span><% } %></div><div class="article-tags"><% page.tags.each(tag => { %><a href="<%= url_for(tag.path) %>"># <%= tag.name %></a><% }); %></div></header><div class="article-layout"><div class="article-main"><article class="prose"><%- page.content %></article><div class="article-signoff"><%- cg_flower() %><div><b>感谢你，停留在这束光里。</b><span>愿每一次探索，都让你更接近热爱的生活。</span></div></div><nav class="post-navigation" aria-label="相邻文章"><% if (page.prev) { %><a href="<%= url_for(page.prev.path) %>"><small>← 更新一篇</small><b><%= page.prev.title %></b></a><% } %><% if (page.next) { %><a href="<%= url_for(page.next.path) %>"><small>再读一篇 →</small><b><%= page.next.title %></b></a><% } %></nav><% if (page.comments !== false) { %><%- partial('_partial/comments') %><% } %></div><aside class="article-sidebar"><div class="toc-box"><p class="section-kicker">ON THIS PAGE</p><h2>在这篇文章里</h2><%- toc(page.content, {list_number: false, max_depth: 3}) %><a class="toc-back" href="<%= url_for('/') %>#writing">← 返回所有文章</a></div></aside></div></div>
